<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian March gross wages up 15.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenian March gross wages up 15.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday.</p>
<p>    AVERAGE GROSS WAGES	  Mar	  Feb	 Mar 96</p>
<p>    in tolars		   138,593     136,811    120,206</p>
<p>    monthly change (pct)	+1.3	 -1.3	 +0.2</p>
<p>    yr/yr change (pct)	 +15.3	+14.1	 +9.7</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
